# App boot gate

There is a reversible access cut via `config/appBoot.ts` → `APP_BOOT_OK`.

- `false` (current intent when unpaid): frontend shows `BootFailure` (generic "No se pudo abrir esta página" / `ERR_FAILED`). Main APIs return 503 via `api/shared/runtimeGuard.ts`.
- `true`: normal app. Set this and redeploy when access should be restored.

Do not add payment language, vendor branding, or “admin paused” messaging to the failure UI. Keep the screen looking like a plain load failure.

Related files: `config/appBoot.ts`, `components/BootFailure.tsx`, `index.tsx`, `api/shared/runtimeGuard.ts`.
